@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> Unregistered

state "Unregistered" as Unregistered
state "Registered" as Registered
state "Watching Video" as WatchingVideo
state "Uploading Video" as UploadingVideo
state "Viewing Likes List" as ViewingLikesList
state "Discussing" as Discussing

Unregistered --> Registered : CreateAccount

Registered --> WatchingVideo : StartWatching

WatchingVideo --> UploadingVideo : UploadVideo
UploadingVideo --> WatchingVideo : [Upload Complete]

WatchingVideo --> ViewingLikesList : SaveToLikes
ViewingLikesList --> WatchingVideo : Back to Video

WatchingVideo --> Discussing : EnterDiscussion
Discussing --> [*] : Exit Discussion

[*] --> Unregistered : Logout

@enduml
